{"3340720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Distant Colony", "steam_appid": 3340720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4886300], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distant Colony</strong> is a sandbox, open-world survival adventure. Take control and transform barren, hostile worlds into thriving human colonies. Play your own way — explore, survive, and build with deep crafting and full freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/184557413cbb19b6200dfba005bf93df.poster.avif?t=1787072547\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/184557413cbb19b6200dfba005bf93df.webm?t=1787072547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/184557413cbb19b6200dfba005bf93df.mp4?t=1787072547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Unknown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore solar systems filled with harsh environments, strange ecosystems, and buried secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Utilize sophisticated exploration equipment to locate valuable minerals, hidden anomalies, and uncover remnants of past civilizations scattered across planetary surfaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/37b9c95c0fe94241f6de86fb3fd02f4f.poster.avif?t=1787072547\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/37b9c95c0fe94241f6de86fb3fd02f4f.webm?t=1787072547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/37b9c95c0fe94241f6de86fb3fd02f4f.mp4?t=1787072547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and Adapt</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival hinges on resource management, environmental adaptation, and strategic planning. Face dynamic threats including extreme climates, radiation, storms, and equipment breakdowns. Manage your oxygen, health and protection to endure and flourish on challenging worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/4b76bd99db2d639df978394005b4a765.poster.avif?t=1787072547\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/4b76bd99db2d639df978394005b4a765.webm?t=1787072547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/4b76bd99db2d639df978394005b4a765.mp4?t=1787072547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Technology and Automation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research and deploy advanced technologies to automate resource extraction, energy management, and life support systems. Develop powerful infrastructure networks and high-tech modules to efficiently sustain your colonies, allowing you to focus on further expansion and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/b084a098a474bb1d990b3620781bd8ad.poster.avif?t=1787072547\