ur colonies, allowing you to focus on further expansion and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/b084a098a474bb1d990b3620781bd8ad.poster.avif?t=1787072547\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/b084a098a474bb1d990b3620781bd8ad.webm?t=1787072547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/extras/b084a098a474bb1d990b3620781bd8ad.mp4?t=1787072547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The stars are calling. But survival is only the beginning.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Explore alien planets in sci-fi survival adventure, gather resources to craft tools, overcome environmental hazards, uncover hidden secrets, and build thriving, self-sustaining colonies with advanced technology. Prepare humanity for a new future among the stars.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/085302b969b0c4bb060b6c6f5fed86862c82867b/header.jpg?t=1787072547", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/ecd5444b7df6c0049c94fb3c6ef9dbad2da2351b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787072547", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340720/ecd5444b7df6c0049c94fb3c6ef9dbad2da2351b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787072547", "website": "https://distantcolony.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stro